'''JD''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by winning a giveaway hosted by JD, or by purchasing merch from the JD [https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3uOXQfZsAU2NMrZxraw5Aw YouTube] Channel. It is now only obtainable through trading. 

== Appearance ==
Its blade has a sparkly appearance and is made up of many geometrical shapes varying in colors such as white blue, purple, and black. The guard is dark purple in color, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
*JD is based off the YouTube channel, [https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3uOXQfZsAU2NMrZxraw5Aw JD].
*It was a targeted victim of [[The Duping Glitch (2017)]], [[The Duping Glitch (2021)]] and [[The Duping Glitch (2022)]].
*Version 1's design for the knife was designed by [[Thexz]] and was uploaded on the same day as he created the YouTuber code knives which is on November 15, 2016. The texture for the knife has been removed from his inventory but still can be access through [https://www.roblox.com/library/546470777/JD-Knife-3 here].
*Version 2's design was also designed by [[Thexz]] and was uploaded on November 26, 2016, 11 days after Version 1's texture was created. The texture for Version 2 has been removed from his inventory but still can be accessed through [https://www.roblox.com/library/557256952/JD-KANEEF-12312312 here].
*This is the only [[Legendary Weapons|Legendary]] YouTuber knife.
*In the secret room in the [[Lobby|Lobby]], [[Zyleak]] is staring at a screen with this knife cracked into it.
**During the 2021 Halloween update, this knife was no longer in the screen in the secret room.
**You can also see it thrown into a canister in [[Research Facility]] map.
**You can also see it laid on a shelf in the [[Police Station]] map.

